  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Peers for Peace building social cohesion in Mopti and Segou Regions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project aims to restore traditional conflict mediation mechanisms and unlock the social and economic capital of peers for peace in the regions of Mopti and Segou to build greater social cohesion and mitigate inter and intra-community conflicts.</narrative>
